From 323cde61f8cb856cc27f91b65e66300db387d2a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Bubu (Soraku FE)" <bubu@soraku.id>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 11:49:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix(build): 3 pre-existing TS errors + sitemap resilience
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

fix(blog): Parameter 't' implicitly has 'any' type
- apps/web/src/app/(public)/blog/[slug]/page.tsx
- post.tags.map(t => ...) → post.tags.map((t: string) => ...)

fix(MarkdownRenderer): Cannot find namespace 'JSX'
- src/components/blog/MarkdownRenderer.tsx
- import type React from 'react'
- JSX.IntrinsicElements → React.JSX.IntrinsicElements

fix(sitemap): Failed to collect page data at build time
- adminDb() gagal saat build lokal/CI tanpa Supabase env vars
- Bungkus semua DB calls dalam try-catch + Promise.allSettled
- Build tanpa env vars → return static pages saja (bukan crash)
- Di Vercel production tetap berjalan normal

fix(next.config): Type conflict NextConfig antara dua versi Next.js
- withMDX(nextConfig) → withMDX(nextConfig as any)

fix(admin/events/[id]/edit): gametype, registrationopen, registrationurl
- State, load, submit payload
- UI: game type grid selector, status buka/tutup, link eksternal
- Priceinfo textarea di section berbayar
