From 4c6b963fba0cd984b9fe5dfe2ff66e532675609c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Bubu (Soraku FE)" <bubu@soraku.id>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 13:31:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] fix(blog): RefObject duck type - kompatibel React 18 & 19
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause deployment ERROR (2x):
  admin/blog/[id]/edit/page.tsx:78 + admin/blog/new/page.tsx
  'RefObject<HTMLTextAreaElement | null>' not assignable to
  'RefObject<HTMLTextAreaElement>' — React 19 ubah behavior useRef<T>(null)

Fix: ubah parameter insertMarkdown() dari React.RefObject<...>
ke duck type { current: HTMLTextAreaElement | null }
→ kompatibel dengan useRef<HTMLTextAreaElement>(null) di React 18 DAN 19
→ tidak perlu cast 'as React.RefObject<HTMLTextAreaElement>' di call site

